<title>SRI LANKA: Distilleries sharply up on high volume.</title>
<headline>Distilleries sharply up on high volume.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Distilleries Co of Sri Lanka Ltd rose 3.13 percent, or 25 cents, to 8.25, on turnover of one million shares on Friday, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The buyer was willing to pay a premium for quantity,&quot; said a local broker who declined to be identified.</p>
<p>The company is Sri Lanka's main producer of alcohol.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
